<title>HUNGARY: Hungary BUBOR steady, six-month rate added.</title>
<headline>Hungary BUBOR steady, six-month rate added.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) remained steady for one-month maturity at 21.27 percent and edged up for three-month to 21.19 percent, up 0.04, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The NBH introduced on Monday a BUBOR rate for the six-month maturity. It was set at 21.04 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
